CX Upcoming Listings</h2></div></div></section><section overflow="hidden !important" class="sc-52755f2-0 gbDhNT"><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0 gKiSAq"><h3 class="sc-2740e774-0 ftmFeI">Why Traders and Investors Trust LCX</h3><p class="sc-30420203-0 fssWOe">We combine compliance, security, and innovation to empower your trading and asset management journey.</p></div><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0 sc-9a3ec88f-0 kndTgy hbgcOK"><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0 sc-9a3ec88f-1 lnhfUf lfMAIo"><p class="sc-30420203-0 kWQqBu">Regulated &amp; Transparent</p><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0 lnhfUf"><ul display="flex" direction="column" class="sc-9a3ec88f-2 jvpMjW"><li class="sc-30420203-2 bbKTXZ"><p class="sc-30420203-0 epANdZ">Registered crypto exchange platform.</p></li><li class="sc-30420203-2 bbKTXZ"><p class="sc-30420203-0 epANdZ">Compliant with blockchain regulations</p></li></ul></div><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Q0jeNtGTBo8vD4bzDh_Q_Gw8W7JmGJcCDDDL3PognrY/preview?edit_requested=true" target="_blank" height="30px" display="flex" font-weight="500" class="sc-30420203-1 joVKhS">Get Started<span transform="rotate(135deg)" class="sc-600b5e67-1 eoMDmB"></span></a></div><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0 sc-9a3ec88f-1 lnhfUf lfMAIo"><p class="sc-30420203-0 kWQqBu">Secure &amp; User-Centric</p><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0 lnhfUf"><ul display="flex" direction="column" class="sc-9a3ec88f-2 jvpMjW"><li class="sc-30420203-2 bbKTXZ"><p class="sc-30420203-0 epANdZ">High security and custody.</p></li><li class="sc-30420203-2 bbKTXZ"><p class="sc-30420203-0 epANdZ">Seamless trading experience.</p></li></ul></div><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1Q0jeNtGTBo8vD4bzDh_Q_Gw8W7JmGJcCDDDL3PognrY/preview?edit_requested=true" target="_blank" height="30px" display="flex" font-weight="500" class="sc-30420203-1 joVKhS">Get Started<span transform="rotate(135deg)" class="sc-600b5e67-1 eoMDmB"></span></a></div></div></section><section overflow="hidden !important" class="sc-52755f2-0 gbDhNT"><div class="sc-874b4c3c-0