\u003e\u003c/var\u003e\",\"Report Released on LCX: \u003cvar dates=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/var\u003e\":\"Report Released on LCX: \u003cvar dates=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/var\u003e\",\"LCX is one of the most important in this space and the world\":\"LCX is one of the most important in this space and the world\",\"LCX's strategic Partnerships\":\"LCX's Strategic Partnerships\",\"LCX's Blockchain Ecosystem\":\"LCX's Blockchain Ecosystem\",\"Comprehensive infrastructure for the new world of finance\":\"Comprehensive infrastructure for the new world of finance\",\"It all started on a napkin\":\"It all started on a napkin\",\"blockchain is the new operating system for the world of finance\":\"Blockchain is the new operating system for the world of finance\",\"Explore crypto insights, market analysis and regulatory perspectives from LCX on digital assets, tokenization and compliant crypto markets．\":\"Explore crypto insights, market analysis and regulatory perspectives from LCX on digital assets, tokenization and compliant crypto markets.\",\"Explore tokenized yield products and earn opportunities designed for compliant and transparent digital asset growth．\":\"Explore tokenized yield products and earn opportunities designed for compliant and transparent digital asset growth.\",\"Explore live crypto prices, charts, trading volume and market data for Bitcoin, Ethereum and digital assets in real time．\":\"Explore live crypto prices, charts, trading volume and market data for Bitcoin, Ethereum and digital assets in real time.\",\"Join LCX | Explore Career Opportunities in the Crypto Industry\":\"Join LCX | Explore Career Opportunities in the Crypto Industry\",\"Explore LCX partners across digital assets, infrastructure and tokenization supporting the LCX ecosystem．\":\"Explore LCX partners across digital assets, infrastructure and tokenization supporting the LCX ecosystem.\",\"Explore ongoing crypto campaigns and promotions on LCX, a crypto exchange regulated in Europe．\":\"Explore ongoing crypto campaigns and promotions on LCX, a crypto exchange regulated in Europe.\",\"Start with read-only API keys to explore market data and check balances． Upgrade to trading permissions only when you are ready．\":\"Start with read-only API keys to explore market data and check balances. Upgrade to trading permissions only when you are ready.\",\"🗺️ What's Next\":\"🗺️ What's Next\",\"Next day, automatic\":\"Next day, automatic\",\"LCX works with leading blockchain protocols, infrastructure providers and financial institutions． Explore the partner network powering a regulated digital asset ecosystem．\":\"LCX works with leading blockchain protocols, infrastructure providers and financial institutions. Explore the partner network powering a regulated digital asset ecosystem.\",\"Tokenize physical assets on LCX — gold, silver, luxury goods and collectibles． Licensed Physical Validator under Liechtenstein's TVTG． Full pipeline: validation, NFT issuance, tokenization bridge and compliant exchange listing．\":\"Tokenize real estate, bonds, equity and commodities on LCX — Europe's regulated RWA infrastructure. Institutional-grade security. Launch your tokenized asset in days.\",\"tokenize physical assets, RWA tokenization, precious metals tokenization, luxury goods tokenization, physical asset tokenization, TVTG tokenization, Liechtenstein blockchain act, NFT tokenization, LCX physical validator, tokenization bridge, LCX tokenization\":\"tokenize real-world assets, RWA tokenization, real estate tokenization, asset tokenization platform, tokenized assets, blockchain tokenization, tokenize bonds equity, LCX tokenization\",\"risk．footer．label\":\"Crypto-Asset Risk Warning\",\"risk．review．line\":\"Crypto-assets are a diverse asset class. Learn more\",\"risk．review．modal．body\":\"Crypto-assets are a diverse asset class, with each asset having unique features that can impact its value and usability. Prices may change rapidly. Once a transaction is executed, it cannot be reversed. Always research and understand the specific risks and characteristics of each asset before trading. See our Terms \u0026 Conditions for more info.\",\"risk．review．modal．cta\":\"I understand\",\"risk．review．modal．title\":\"Crypto-Asset Risk Notice\",\"risk．promo．short\":\"Digital asset prices are volatile. Your investment may lose or gain value, and LCX is not liable for any losses. You are solely responsible for your investment decisions. Not financial advice. See our Terms \u0026 Conditions for more info.\",\"risk．promo．shortest\":\"Crypto is volatile. Not financial advice. lcx.com/risk\",\"risk．mica_art7．disclaimer\":\"This crypto-asset marketing communication has not been reviewed or approved by any competent authority in any Member State of the European Union. LCX is solely responsible for the content of this crypto-asset marketing communication.\",\"risk．fullpage．title\":\"Crypto-Asset Risk Warning\",\"risk．fullpage．lastUpdated\":\"Last updated\",\"risk．fullpage．intro\":\"Before trading or investing in crypto-assets on LCX, please read and understand the following key risks.\",\"risk．fullpage．volatility．title\":\"Price Volatility\",\"risk．fullpage．volatility．body\":\"Crypto-asset prices are highly volatile and can fluctuate significantly in a short period. You may lose some or all of the value of your investment.\",\"risk．fullpage．noGuarantee．title\":\"No Deposit Guarantee\",\"risk．fullpage．noGuarantee．body\":\"Crypto-assets held on LCX are not covered by any deposit guarantee scheme. There is no government or institutional protection if LCX ceases to operate.\",\"risk．fullpage．loseAll．title\":\"Risk of Total Loss\",\"risk．fullpage．loseAll．body\":\"The value of a crypto-asset can fall to zero. You should only invest what you can afford to lose entirely.\",\"risk．fullpage．pastPerformance．title\":\"Past Performance is Not Indicative\",\"risk．fullpage．pastPerformance．body\":\"Historical prices and returns of crypto-assets are not a reliable indicator of future performance.\",\"risk．fullpage．liquidity．title\":\"Liquidity Risk\",\"risk．fullpage．liquidity．body\":\"Some crypto-assets may have limited liquidity, meaning you may not be able to sell or exchange them at the desired time or price.\",\"risk．fullpage．irreversibility．title\":\"Irreversibility of Transactions\",\"risk．fullpage．irreversibility．body\":\"Blockchain transactions are generally irreversible. Once a transaction is executed, it cannot be cancelled or reversed.\",\"risk．fullpage．regulatory．title\":\"Regulatory Risk\",\"risk．fullpage．regulatory．body\":\"The regulatory environment for crypto-assets is evolving. Changes in laws or regulations may affect the value, legality, or availability of certain crypto-assets.\",\"risk．fullpage．responsibility．title\":\"Your Responsibility\",\"risk．fullpage．responsibility．body\":\"You are solely responsible for your investment decisions. LCX does not provide financial, legal, or investment advice. Always seek independent professional advice before investing.\",\"risk．fullpage．learnMore\":\"For further information, please review our Terms \u0026 Conditions.\",\"risk．fullpage．complaint．title\":\"File a Complaint\",\"risk．fullpage．complaint．body\":\"If you believe your rights as a client have not been respected or you are dissatisfied with our services, you have the right to file a formal complaint with LCX. We are committed to addressing all complaints fairly and promptly.\",\"risk．fullpage．complaint．link\":\"Submit a complaint via our Complaint Form\",\"risk．fullpage．technology．title\":\"Technology and Cybersecurity Risk\",\"risk．fullpage．technology．body\":\"Crypto-assets rely on underlying blockchain protocols and software. These systems may contain bugs, vulnerabilities, or be subject to cyberattacks, network failures, or other technical issues that could result in loss of assets. While LCX implements industry-standard security measures, no system is completely immune from technical failure or malicious attack.\",\"risk．fullpage．furtherInfo．title\":\"Further Information\",\"risk．fullpage．furtherInfo．body\":\"For a complete understanding of the risks associated with using LCX services, please review our Terms \u0026 Conditions and the applicable crypto-asset white papers. LCX AG has applied for authorisation under MiCA (EU 2023/1114); the application is under review by the FMA Liechtenstein. LCX AG is not currently authorised under MiCA; MiCA-regulated services for EEA clients are paused; see the MiCA Notice.\",\"risk．fullpage．address\":\"LCX AG · Herrengasse 6 · 9490 Vaduz · Liechtenstein · hello@lcx.com · www.lcx.com\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．title\":\"Jurisdiction Notice\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．eea．label\":\"European Economic Area (EEA):\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．eea．body\":\"LCX AG has not yet been granted authorisation under Regulation (EU) 2023/1114 (MiCA) to provide crypto-asset services to clients in the European Economic Area, and its application for authorisation remains under review by the Financial Market Authority (FMA) Liechtenstein. Pending the outcome, LCX AG has suspended the provision of crypto-asset services to clients in the EEA. The content of this website is not directed at persons in the EEA and does not constitute an offer or solicitation to any person in the EEA.\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．uk．label\":\"United Kingdom:\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．uk．body\":\"LCX AG does not provide services to clients in the United Kingdom. The content of this website and any communications by LCX are not directed at persons in the UK and do not constitute a financial promotion to UK persons within the meaning of section 21 of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000, except where directed at persons falling within an exemption under the Financial Promotion Order 2005, in particular investment professionals (Art. 19), high net worth companies (Art. 49), certified high net worth individuals (Art. 48) and certified sophisticated investors (Art. 50/50A). Any UK person not falling within these categories should not act on the content of this website.\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．us．label\":\"United States:\",\"risk．fullpage．jurisdictions．us．body\":\"LCX AG does not provide services to persons in the United States. The content of this website is not directed at US persons and does not constitute an offer or solicitation to any person in the United States.\",\"The LCX tokenization pipeline takes a real-world asset from physical inspection to a regulated, liquid digital market — entirely within a single compliant framework． Each step — validation, custody, token issuance, on-chain certification, bridging, and exchange listing — is executed under the Liechtenstein TVTG, ensuring legal enforceability and regulatory integrity at every stage．\":\"The LCX tokenization pipeline takes a real-world asset from physical inspection to a regulated, liquid digital market — entirely within a single compliant framework. Each step — validation, custody, token issuance, on-chain certification, bridging, and exchange listing — is executed under the Liechtenstein TVTG, ensuring legal enforceability and regulatory integrity at every stage.\",\"This end-to-end approach eliminates the fragmentation typical of multi-party tokenization workflows． Asset owners, institutions, and projects work with a single regulated counterparty responsible for the entire chain of trust — from the vault to the exchange order book — reducing counterparty risk and providing a single point of accountability under Liechtenstein law．\":\"This end-to-end approach eliminates the fragmentation typical of multi-party tokenization workflows. Asset owners, institutions, and projects work with a single regulated counterparty responsible for the entire chain of trust — from the vault to the exchange order book — reducing counterparty risk and providing a single point of accountability under Liechtenstein law.\",\"Example: A family office tokenizes a portfolio of GIA-certified diamonds through LCX． The assets are physically validated, placed in a regulated Liechtenstein vault, issued as NFTs, bridged into fungible ERC-20 tokens, and listed on the LCX Exchange — all within one regulatory framework, giving investors auditable, compliant exposure to real-world assets．\":\"Example: A family office tokenizes a portfolio of GIA-certified diamonds through LCX. The assets are physically validated, placed in a regulated Liechtenstein vault, issued as NFTs, bridged into fungible ERC-20 tokens, and listed on the LCX Exchange — all within one regulatory framework, giving investors auditable, compliant exposure to real-world assets.\",\"Your funds should show up \u003cb\u003ealmost instantly．\u003c/b\u003e\":\"Your funds should show up \u003cb\u003ealmost instantly.\u003c/b\u003e\",\"Below payment options we currently support for purchases．\\n        \u003cul\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Main Balance \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Credit/ Debit (Decta) \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Credit/ Debit (Unlimit)  \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Clear Junction \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e SEPA (Unlimit) \u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003c/ul\u003e\":\"Below payment options we currently support for purchases.\\n        \u003cul\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Main Balance \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Credit/ Debit (Decta) \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Credit/ Debit (Unlimit)  \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e Clear Junction \u003c/li\u003e\\n          \u003cli\u003e SEPA (Unlimit) \u003c/li\u003e\\n        \u003c/ul\u003e\",\"Yes． A 1% fixed LCX platform fee applies to every Buy Crypto transaction． In addition, a payment provider fee is charged, which varies depending on the provider you choose．\\n You can view the full breakdown on the confirmation screen before you complete your purchase．\\n For detailed provider fees, check the Fee Structure by clicking \u003cbr/\u003e \u003ca style=\\\"color:blue;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://lcx．com/en/fee\\\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e:\":\"Yes. A 1% fixed LCX platform fee applies to every Buy Crypto transaction. In addition, a payment provider fee is charged, which varies depending on the provider you choose.\\n You can view the full breakdown on the confirmation screen before you complete your purchase.\\n For detailed provider fees, check the Fee Structure by clicking \u003cbr/\u003e \u003ca style=\\\"color:blue;\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://lcx.com/en/fee\\\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e:\",\"If your payment or order doesn’t go through, you’ll see an on-screen message explaining the issue． Any funds that were successfully transferred will be credited to your main wallet, so you can use them anytime． \u003cbr/\u003e\\nIf something looks off or feels strange, our support team \u003ca style=\\\"color:blue;\\\" href=\\\"mailto:hello@lcx．com\\\"\u003ehello@lcx．com\u003c/a\u003e is just one click away．\":\"If your payment or order doesn’t go through, you’ll see an on-screen message explaining the issue. Any funds that were successfully transferred will be credited to your main wallet, so you can use them anytime. \u003cbr/\u003e\\nIf something looks off or feels strange, our support team \u003ca style=\\\"color:blue;\\\" href=\\\"mailto:hello@lcx.com\\\"\u003ehello@lcx.com\u003c/a\u003e is just one click away.\",\"Explore the assets available on LCX Exchange\":\"Explore the assets available on LCX Exchange\",\"Explore LCX Exchange\":\"Explore LCX Exchange\",\"Explore live prices for top digital assets by market cap．\":\"Explore live prices for top digital assets by market cap.\",\"\u003cvar token=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/var\u003e Deposit Disabled\":\"\u003cvar token=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/var\u003e Deposit Disabled\",\"\u003cvar token=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/var\u003e Withdrawal Disabled\":\"\u003cvar token=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/var\u003e Withdrawal Disabled\"},\"children\":\"$L2a\"}]]\n2b:I[170315,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b3sj9yt2vymb.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ptpzt2-_j87j.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3gitqisqv2wxj.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1km3sqkh10maa.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2l4qydplnk8z8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3nvs_rkj6mhhz.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/17-0h93q3t0lx.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0jr0qmxdmb0m3.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2yvopc-7bi7rz.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3i4mhpa-j_czl.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/42_k4gu57-96a.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/140d5g2hbus4r.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0s27niekk30t6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3n43cbwv4-ufo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00qpvwlqn8xqv.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xnzbhniim291.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/05yufy04bjchx.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/31zhu-sd-87o9.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0i9o_69sbcct0.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0wi175sokv70l.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1j5loh3go9bun.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2_7_fflkokim_.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/383v3difx9-tk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/04mdsdzmbvoz5.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2ae-eh4z-joyd.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0wlsmkvx33qrj.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0zxyjtz99kjn2.js\"],\"MarketProvider\"]\n2c:I[241816,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b3sj9yt2vymb.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ptpzt2-_j87j.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3gitqisqv2wxj.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1km3sqkh10maa.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2l4qydplnk8z8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3nvs_rkj6mhhz.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/17-0h93q3t0lx.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0jr0qmxdmb0m3.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2yvopc-7bi7rz.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3i4mhpa-j_czl.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/42_k4gu57-96a.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/140d5g2hbus4r.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0s27niekk30t6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3n43cbwv4-ufo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00qpvwlqn8xqv.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xnzbhniim291.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/05yufy04bjchx.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/31zhu-sd-87o9.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0i9o_69sbcct0.js\",\"/_